# Task 3 Report: Hash-Pinned PIT Price Export

## Status

`DONE_WITH_CONCERNS / BLOCKED_BY_APPROVED_CACHE`

The strict exporter is implemented and committed. The required first 2020-2025 export was correctly rejected before publication because the approved hash-pinned cache does not contain the required 2020 warm-up prices and achieves only 84.90755026% full-calendar member coverage. No coverage gate was relaxed and no external source was introduced.

## Commit

- `da9837f feat: export validated PIT price bars`

Only the requested source files were committed:

